{"version":1,"key":"article:13","content":{"id":13,"title":"JavaScript 控制对象的访问","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b5b1328a-f04d-46c9-9d17-a1724a2c9ccc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本篇文章总结控制对象访问的相关 API。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"c0358b24-b599-4400-b557-855c9239541e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.defineProperty"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2e6d25d6-2c47-45b0-9f46-ec138fccbd58","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.defineProperty"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以对对象的属性进行配置，它接收如下参数："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f0534de0-d189-4377-a5c1-c6a00a4e1942","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"be3260c1-90d9-4ea9-af9d-6c4241259541","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1b0b633a-7da8-4555-b813-bc415c8527f8","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：对象"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ad28ca20-6247-4fbe-83e6-0ce5f130c18f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4b22e4e6-9621-40bd-984d-7239169e86db","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prop"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：属性"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"98306500-87f5-4011-ad1f-1e8163117eab","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"596b89ca-cfbe-46e0-8b44-10cac3651154","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"descriptor"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：属性描述符"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2b520ef5-e5db-46c0-a957-a370621b05b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"descriptor"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包括如下配置选项"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"99f73d4f-5758-4383-9961-93ff46e02b1f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cc5ad647-4f62-4b08-a786-5634ed4c498a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cd5a76fa-f3db-43fb-a8af-bc586f0e9f44","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"value"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：属性的值"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"396059ae-f4fc-4fc5-95c5-5ce26bdc5d67","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ece2981c-3eee-469d-9aa5-fb496cec250b","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"writable"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：属性是否可写，默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6af3e1e3-021b-4ac8-8bf5-dbcc2d6c99ad","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6686323d-e245-49cb-9857-8e5f6e0e8f51","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：为属性设置值时会触发此方法，设置的新值会作为参数传入"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"895955a7-1130-41fb-905e-db816377c1c1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5791f7d4-b474-4c91-89c4-a05a3d44faf0","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：访问此属性是会触发此方法"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4678cbd7-dd09-46d4-a1df-68f20e935fe0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f43e41f4-73a0-4a21-8799-c4d6a3c081f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"configurable"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：该属性是否可再次进行配置，默认为 f"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"alse"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fde8d997-4ada-49e8-b9c3-158ff48be633","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"78b186c8-e923-419f-bfac-2084a016230d","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"enumerable"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：是否可遍历，默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"613d8053-0240-4a66-88ca-1ca86959f219","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"value"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"writable"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一组，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一组，二者不可同时使用。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"678fe7e3-d309-4a84-9376-034b1f79f082","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子1"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"f3ec2bde-739f-4621-a3c2-6c97f848bda3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8c03f558-622a-4856-aaa5-f4d953ff5438","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {}\n\nObject.defineProperty(obj, 'name', {\n    value: 'Alice',\n    writable: false\n})\n\nconsole.log(obj.name) // Alice\n\nobj.name = 'Bob'      // 不可写，更改无效\nconsole.log(obj.name) // Alice","collabId":"b8cc2b23-b2c1-4bfe-adf1-0d3810710b7f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"14570ab7-8ccd-430a-a9da-737653d1dca1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在上面我们为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"name"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性配置了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"value"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性为 Alice 作为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj.name"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的初始值，又配置了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"writable"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表明该属性是不可写的，对该属性进行赋值时无效的。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"23ffd0d9-0738-4da1-aca6-cea11ab53d6a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子2"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"ac948ad0-12c0-441b-bff1-36625c90795f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"49c8074c-8830-4ab2-97bb-98e464528a6e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {}\n\nlet username\nObject.defineProperty(obj, 'name', {\n    set(value) {\n        if (value === 'Alice') {\n            username = value\n        }\n    },\n    get() {\n        return username\n    }\n})\n\nobj.name = 'Alice'     // 赋值有效\nconsole.log(obj.name)  // Alice\n\nobj.name = 'Bob'       // 赋值无效 \nconsole.log(obj.name)  // Alice","collabId":"cb5752f4-49b3-49bf-9618-80e3107ebce3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4f9e333d-2aac-4e7f-a7a0-01b3eb0e0659","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"name"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性配置了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，没当我们为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj.name"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 赋予新值时都会调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，并将新值传入，在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法中，我们对新值进行了判断，如果新值为 Alice 则我们赋值给 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"username"},{"type":"formatted","text":"；每次当我们访问 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj.name"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，则会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法中我们直接返回了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"username"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个变量的值，通过这种方式可以控制对象属性的访问操作。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"8bf40544-ee5e-45e0-8636-d4610b4d8f79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子3"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"484d71f5-4077-44fa-bd9b-9b224d47498a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d0ab8f11-760b-4521-8a57-508fd3047ae9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: 2\n}\nconsole.log(Object.keys(obj)) // [ 'a', 'b' ]\n\n\nObject.defineProperty(obj, 'a', {\n    enumerable: false         // 不可枚举\n})\nconsole.log(Object.keys(obj)) // [ 'b' ]","collabId":"84f069d5-e8a4-4f84-8146-ee0c04f122d9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a92f4e22-9337-4c5d-b11f-f21b0b4eaef3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在上面我们定义了一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，其中有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"a"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"b"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 两个属性，默认都是可枚举的。通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.keys"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法可以取得对象中所以可枚举的属性，这时它们都在返回的数组中；接着我们配置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为不可枚举，此时再次调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.keys"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，此时 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就不在返回的数组中了。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"811edae5-ae88-4542-a8e5-23548bd576b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子4"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"41e0f721-fbd6-4883-9bb1-ef9800209403","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f9e52782-23de-469f-8f02-dfb73e8a4971","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: 2\n}\n\nObject.defineProperty(obj, 'a', {\n    enumerable: false,\n    configurable: false\n})\n\nconsole.log(Object.keys(obj)) // [ 'b' ]\n\n// TypeError: Cannot redefine property: a\nObject.defineProperty(obj, 'a', {\n    enumerable: true\n})","collabId":"e70886c7-ffbd-4058-90ae-37e2cfc0fea8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bd9a5a6a-c8f0-4d6c-9cfa-a73d134033d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们配置了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为不可枚举，并且配置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"configurable"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后接着我们又想配置属性 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为可枚举的，但是会报错 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"TypeError: Cannot redefine property: a"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这是因为我们配置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"configurable"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示不可再次配置，当我们再次对属性 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行配置便会报错。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"d5553963-4bb8-4e4a-808f-4e5b953d31b4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c7b0dd12-91da-4008-b672-2e1fddf0b381","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: 2\n}\n\nObject.defineProperty(obj, 'a', {\n    enumerable: false,\n    configurable: true        // 可继续配置\n})\nconsole.log(Object.keys(obj)) // [ 'b' ]\n\nObject.defineProperty(obj, 'a', {\n    enumerable: true\n})\nconsole.log(Object.keys(obj)) // [ 'a', 'b' ]","collabId":"0107868c-7b2e-4b87-9f53-dc29537ce1af","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"520de95a-fb6c-491a-861b-1fdfef32b6c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.defineProperties"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2bb62ab4-9633-4d40-8bdd-e8631a914942","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.defineProperty"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 每次只能配置对象的一个属性，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.defineProperties"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以一次性配置对象的多个属性，它的语法如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"c6e35e6f-b64d-47e7-a2b9-c4d518bc23c7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3590dad0-80bc-4e03-bff4-0b4c6d873885","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Object.defineProperties(obj, {\n    prop1: {\n        // 配置选项同 Object.defineProperty\n    },\n    prop2: {\n        // ...\n    }\n})","collabId":"74f6b00f-08a9-44ac-8287-961d4fcab794","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"07a8bc30-aaee-4da1-ba57-b59994518d7b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"见下例："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"daace985-adc4-4f42-80fb-191978562b6d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2bb6dcc0-6466-41e5-8e1f-4882b7997641","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    name: 'Alice',\n    age: 25\n}\n\nObject.defineProperties(obj, {\n    name: {\n        writable: false    // 不能写 name 属性\n    },\n    age: {\n        enumerable: false, // 不能遍历到 age 这个属性\n        get() {\n            return 18      // 别问，问就是 18\n        }\n    }\n})","collabId":"741ccc21-05b1-49a1-aece-7e1904c20a11","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"82e037b6-ba9b-47dd-a80e-924bd15cd68a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.preventExtensions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"310dcde6-1d88-43e9-9708-bf1936037450","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.preventExtions(obj)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以使得对象 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不可扩展，即不能为对象添加新的属性"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"783330e5-ddbf-4b3d-b212-ffd41bb200d6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"476470c2-6f18-45d4-92f2-44aa8c9d30a5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    name: 'Alice',\n    age: 20\n}\n\nObject.preventExtensions(obj)\n\nobj.gender = 'female'   // 无法添加新的属性\nconsole.log(obj.gender) // undefined","collabId":"9812269d-4589-43eb-b451-cec57c738510","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8564aa47-6b81-4f58-b069-187e869ad627","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"obj"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为不可扩展后试图添加新的属性，但是并没有成功。设置为不可扩展后，我们可以正常访问现有对象上的属性，以及更改和删除"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"03f0bfa0-4de2-4c3f-9c4e-e46f373fb6e8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"feba86ad-30ba-40e8-ad88-301d3cbc05c8","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    name: 'Alice',\n    age: 20\n}\n\nObject.preventExtensions(obj)\n\nobj.name = 'Bob'\nconsole.log(obj.name)  // Bob\n\ndelete obj.name\nconsole.log(Object.keys(obj)) // [ 'age' ]","collabId":"e53796b8-4dac-4663-a214-ab16a5f00bf1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b23e9c94-8ee0-4474-b99d-8d0a7eac6b1e","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"对象一旦变为不可扩展后，就一直是不可扩展的。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.isExtensible"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法可以判断一个对象是否是可扩展的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"4a12d069-a598-4cbf-9acd-2e09bf1a2172","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"97e898f5-5741-41fb-9b74-a027e30b19fa","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    name: 'Alice',\n    age: 20\n}\n\nconsole.log(Object.isExtensible(obj)) // true\nObject.preventExtensions(obj)\nconsole.log(Object.isExtensible(obj)) // false","collabId":"23094aa8-4fa4-43ee-b6af-33aad38ed6f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a98760e7-520a-44b6-98e8-a87f3060cd7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.seal"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"40816e02-719f-417c-ab82-ea01c9932959","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"seal"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的意思是封印，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.seal"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 比 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.preventExtensiable"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 更近一步，被 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"seal"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 了的对象，除了变为不可扩展，还不可配置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"configurable: false"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，属性不能被删除了以及属性不能被 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.defineProperty"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行配置了"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"08d6c029-c72d-4690-a18d-e6065713ae3a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"905e7ee3-1dce-495d-ba8b-506ac22f889c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    name: 'Alice',\n    age: 20\n}\n\nObject.seal(obj)\n\nobj.gender = 'female'\nconsole.log(obj.female) // undefined, 不可扩展\n\ndelete obj.name\nconsole.log(obj.name)   // Alice, 不可删除","collabId":"5d6a3a3a-472d-44e5-8d22-7a332b292f8a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b4da0552-196d-405b-9d65-0df4d0882ec5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是我们还可以对象现有的属性进行更改的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"a9f7b01f-bae0-4ed8-8001-62727b2659ad","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"65cf0543-091a-4bca-a796-61c7b7999080","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    name: 'Alice',\n    age: 20\n}\n\nObject.seal(obj)\n\nobj.name = 'Bob'\nconsole.log(obj.name) // Bob","collabId":"ac25cb04-31a0-4505-b54c-d8c807620347","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c1bb364a-9e1b-447b-ba35-b3075732f158","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.isSealed"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以判断对象是否被 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"seal"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 了"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"e807f2e6-21d9-4c77-8938-887f8a317ae5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"26bfe822-8e5f-4743-8679-b2939e54249d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {}\n\nconsole.log(Object.isSealed(obj)) // false\nObject.seal(obj)\nconsole.log(Object.isSealed(obj)) // true","collabId":"1c3ea1ba-e819-470f-9fb2-5731ffcdacfd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"19e00d02-4607-4c04-b697-3f2f53066587","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.freeze"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a188ae03-fcb1-4e92-a1b0-e248f8e27661","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"freeze"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是冻结的意思，它相对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.seal"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 更进一步，不仅不可扩展，不可配置，对象的数据属性 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"writable"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会被设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"4a1b60f0-3280-40be-84ff-3729c84f55b3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1f8a719d-b4c4-4a2f-962b-5dac0410826c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    name: 'Alice'\n}\n\nObject.freeze(obj)\n\nobj.age = 18     // 不可扩展，无效\nobj.name = 'Bob' // 不可修改，无效\ndelete obj.name  // 不可配置，无效\n\nconsole.log(obj) // { name: 'Alice' }","collabId":"3f28cbfb-a434-4821-ac92-58ffa50551bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f1780975-944d-429d-b0eb-a07ef093c29b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是如果有定义 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法的话，对象属性还是可以被修改的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"42e0443e-ce0f-4512-aea8-da201779d8f0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2eaf0839-469b-4720-a3a9-b6700a762855","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {\n    name: 'Alice'\n}\n\nlet username = obj.name\nObject.defineProperty(obj, 'name', {\n    set(value) {\n        username = value\n    },\n    get() {\n        return username\n    }\n})\n\nObject.freeze(obj)\n\nobj.name = 'Bob'\nconsole.log(obj.name) // Bob","collabId":"82ae1846-3694-4296-b582-0206a48f48d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"816ae64f-40a6-4e37-9aa8-e71796799be1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.isFrozen"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法可以判断一个对象是否被 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"freeze"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 了"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"1ab9a27c-5215-4a24-9551-fcbdef68d4f2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"67be62b5-2697-40d9-ba7b-afd08648ae26","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const obj = {}\n\nconsole.log(Object.isFrozen(obj)) // false\nObject.freeze(obj)\nconsole.log(Object.isFrozen(obj)) // true","collabId":"db2fb04c-a40e-4d36-8280-793a71772fc2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"e907f955-30b7-4177-a456-53d6561b0581","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Proxy"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"30df717e-4e0a-4eae-a908-761d4c2bbc09","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Proxy"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 ES6 中的新特性，它可以为对象做一层代理，当用户通过代理访问对象时，代理可以拦截一些操作，例如为属性赋值，访问属性的值，从而控制对象的访问。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Proxy"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以拦截 13 种操作，这里不会详细介绍，只会介绍 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 拦截。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"17c0f362-ce8b-4dd5-9411-e6f9b0499319","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Proxy"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的语法如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"55631db4-ca13-46f1-950a-092fc095a2aa","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c10546e8-a149-437f-bf4f-4c31f4826be6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const proxy = new Proxy(target, {\n    // 拦截的方法\n})","collabId":"16f0c646-b4c6-44c5-aa38-c144392aa3a4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"c49481ff-71f5-4736-bf84-bab465e51b6d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子1"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"425f3a77-7c2a-44d0-8a1b-4ad47a6d59c7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e9f4e988-b903-4570-a8ba-848b31f02802","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const target = {\n    name: 'Alice',\n    age: 18\n}\n\nlet proxy = new Proxy(target, {\n    set(trapTarget, key, value, receiver) {\n        // 只能为 age 属性赋值，并且值必须不大于 18 才能赋值成功\n        if (key === 'age' && value <= 18) {\n            trapTarget[key] = value\n        }\n    }\n})\n\n// 无法为 name 赋值\nproxy.name = 'Bob'\nconsole.log(proxy.name)  // Alice\nconsole.log(target.name) // Alice\n\n// 大于 18 赋值失败\nproxy.age = 19\nconsole.log(proxy.age)   // 18\nconsole.log(target.age)  // 18\n\n// 不大于 18，赋值成功\nproxy.age = 15\nconsole.log(proxy.age)   // 15\nconsole.log(target.age)  // 15","collabId":"3702d716-d6c8-4198-ab4d-e62c8a745755","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"533a2328-c309-4489-b39b-28a41ae9b0f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象做了层代理，当我们通过代理赋值时，会被 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法拦截，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法接收四个参数："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"5eea9df3-63a6-4ef2-8135-e3996b682015","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4d25cb85-467c-452e-b512-6d95fa46415b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"55923043-9489-4214-bbd1-b039f2bbcb30","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"trapTarget"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：被代理的对象"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"271aa89d-8cfd-4f8b-89c1-9b229e08f3b0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"089cebe5-fcae-4c2a-81e9-ff9d40421de3","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"key"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：被赋值的属性"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"531bd46a-41e9-4369-b484-e4dfd56f0d48","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"547e9329-dbdf-4d13-994d-c9c4353d46e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"value"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：被赋的值"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c9aea669-9cc8-445a-9612-5d38c2925301","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09308bc2-2019-4c8d-b2a7-ddf147ecfaf3","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"receiver"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：操作发生的对象，即代理对象"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d7905b2e-b086-44a7-a36c-76f3cd8e95f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们只允许对 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"age"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性赋值，并且赋的值不能大于 18。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"0f2731dd-497c-4d11-8f32-cf7c074d0a7e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子2"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"3fd5c874-0525-46a4-9f72-3dc8f71110f6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"20e3922d-7788-4f27-893d-56b53b799f17","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const target = {\n    name: 'Alice',\n    age: 20\n}\n\nlet proxy = new Proxy(target, {\n    get(trapTarget, key, receiver) {\n        if (key === 'age') {\n            return 18\n        }\n        return trapTarget[key]\n    }\n})\n\nconsole.log(proxy.age)  // 18\nconsole.log(target.age) // 20","collabId":"bde6b262-52ae-4ec7-b153-2161c6beafc4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"067b02ff-7274-475a-9def-8bb8f3411b19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们对 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法进行了代理，当我们通过代理对象访问属性值时，如果访问的是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"age"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，则返回 18，其他属性不做处理直接返回原值。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"0f55862a-1607-4f14-96f2-6ac775c2b1d2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d712053b-6333-4161-a46e-1df24ff7d453","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果直接通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 访问属性的话，操作是不会被拦截的，代理没有作用。"}]}]}],"tags":["defineProperty","defineProperties","preventExtensions","seal","freeze","Proxy"],"bannerBg":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/wallhaven-o3wzql_3ee34654-e752-441b-ae77-ef437fa3a246.jpg","createTime":1618323480000,"updateTime":1743303640463},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1743303640463}}